{"Title":"An Act relative to the expungement of non-convictions ","BillNumber":"S988","DocketNumber":"SD75","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T14:17:32.593"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T14:17:32.5933333"},{"Id":"BMA1","Name":"Brian M. Ashe","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BMA1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T10:11:09.4433333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S988/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Gobi, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 988) of Anne M. Gobi and Brian M. Ashe for legislation relative to the expungement of non-convictions.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 100K of Chapter 276 of the Massachusetts General Laws is hereby amended by including, after subsection (a) the following new subsection:   \r\n\t(xx) Notwithstanding the requirements of section 100I and section 100J, a court may further order the expungement of a record created as a result of a criminal court appearance, juvenile court appearance or dispositions if: \r\n\t(1) such court appearance resulted in the accused, by a final judgment, being found non-guilty of the charge or the charge is dismissed;  \r\n\t(2) a charge in a criminal case has been nolled in the Superior Court and at least thirteen months have elapsed since such nolle; or  \r\n\t(3) a charge in a criminal case has been continued at the request of the prosecuting attorney, and a period of thirteen months has elapsed since the granting of such continuance during which period there has been no prosecution or other disposition of the matter. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}